      <title>英伟达129亿美元收购Hugging Face：防御性布局锁定开源AI生态</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260904/%E8%8B%B1%E4%BC%9F%E8%BE%BE129%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E6%94%B6%E8%B4%ADHugging-Face%E9%98%B2%E5%BE%A1%E6%80%A7%E5%B8%83%E5%B1%80%E9%94%81%E5%AE%9A%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90AI%E7%94%9F%E6%80%81/</link>
